{"seq":4,"slug":"geospatial-regression","title":"地理空间回归模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/geospatial-data-analysis/spatial-statistics/geospatial-regression","wordCount":1491,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"地理空间回归模型\">地理空间回归模型</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>空间回归模型在经典回归的基础上显式纳入空间依赖性和空间异质性。当观测数据具有空间自相关时，普通最小二乘法（OLS）的残差独立性假设被违反，导致系数估计偏差和推断无效。空间回归通过空间滞后项、空间误差项或地理加权方法来捕捉这些空间效应。空间回归是房价建模、公共卫生、环境科学和犯罪学等领域的核心分析工具。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[空间回归模型] --&gt; B[全局模型]&#10;    A --&gt; C[局部模型]&#10;    B --&gt; D[空间滞后模型 SLM]&#10;    B --&gt; E[空间误差模型 SEM]&#10;    B --&gt; F[空间杜宾模型 SDM]&#10;    C --&gt; G[地理加权回归 GWR]&#10;    C --&gt; H[多尺度 GWR]&#10;    A --&gt; I[模型诊断]&#10;    I --&gt; J[Moran&#39;s I 检验]&#10;    I --&gt; K[LM 检验]\">graph TD\n    A[空间回归模型] --&gt; B[全局模型]\n    A --&gt; C[局部模型]\n    B --&gt; D[空间滞后模型 SLM]\n    B --&gt; E[空间误差模型 SEM]\n    B --&gt; F[空间杜宾模型 SDM]\n    C --&gt; G[地理加权回归 GWR]\n    C --&gt; H[多尺度 GWR]\n    A --&gt; I[模型诊断]\n    I --&gt; J[Moran's I 检验]\n    I --&gt; K[LM 检验]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>空间效应类型</th>\n<th>核心方程</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>估计方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>OLS</td>\n<td>无（基准）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>X</mi><mi>β</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y = X\\beta + \\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>无空间效应</td>\n<td>最小二乘</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SLM</td>\n<td>空间溢出</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mi>W</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>X</mi><mi>β</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y = \\rho Wy + X\\beta + \\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>因变量受邻居影响</td>\n<td>ML / 2SLS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SEM</td>\n<td>空间扰动</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>X</mi><mi>β</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>W</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y = X\\beta + \\lambda Wu + \\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">λW</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>遗漏变量空间相关</td>\n<td>ML / GMM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SDM</td>\n<td>溢出+解释变量滞后</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mi>W</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>X</mi><mi>β</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>W</mi><mi>X</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y = \\rho Wy + X\\beta + WX\\theta + \\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>综合空间效应</td>\n<td>ML</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GWR</td>\n<td>空间异质性</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi>β</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y_i = X_i\\beta(u_i,v_i) + \\varepsilon_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>关系随位置变化</td>\n<td>加权最小二乘</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"空间权重矩阵\">空间权重矩阵</h2><p>空间权重矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 是空间回归的核心构建模块，定义了观测单元之间的空间邻接关系。权重矩阵的选择直接影响模型结果的解释。</p>\n<p><strong>邻接法</strong>：Queen 邻接（共享边或顶点）和 Rook 邻接（仅共享边）。适用于面状数据（如行政区划），区域之间要么相邻（权重为 1）要么不相邻（权重为 0）。</p>\n<p><strong>距离法</strong>：K 最近邻（KNN）和距离阈值。KNN 保证每个观测点有固定数量的邻居，适用于点密度不均的数据。距离阈值将阈值内的所有点视为邻居，但不同区域的邻居数可能差异很大。</p>\n<p>权重矩阵通常进行行标准化——每行权重之和为 1，使得 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Wy</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 的含义变为&quot;邻居值的加权平均&quot;。行标准化使空间滞后项的解释更直观，但会改变矩阵的对称性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"空间诊断检验\">空间诊断检验</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import numpy as np&#10;import geopandas as gpd&#10;from libpysal.weights import Queen&#10;from spreg import OLS, ML_Lag, ML_Error, GM_Lag&#10;&#10;gdf = gpd.read_file(&quot;districts.shp&quot;)&#10;w = Queen.from_dataframe(gdf)&#10;w.transform = &#39;r&#39;&#10;&#10;y = gdf[&#39;house_price&#39;].values.reshape(-1, 1)&#10;X = gdf[[&#39;income&#39;, &#39;school_count&#39;, &#39;park_area&#39;, &#39;distance_cbd&#39;]].values&#10;&#10;ols = OLS(y, X, w=w, spat_diag=True,&#10;          name_y=&#39;house_price&#39;,&#10;          name_x=[&#39;income&#39;, &#39;school_count&#39;, &#39;park_area&#39;, &#39;distance_cbd&#39;])\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> geopandas </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gpd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> libpysal.weights </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Queen</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> spreg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> OLS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ML_Lag</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ML_Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">GM_Lag</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gdf </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gpd.read_file(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"districts.shp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Queen.from_dataframe(gdf)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">w.transform </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'r'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gdf[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'house_price'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].values.reshape(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">X </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gdf[[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'income'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'school_count'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'park_area'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'distance_cbd'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]].values</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ols </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OLS(y, X, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">w</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">w, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">spat_diag</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">          name_y</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'house_price'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">          name_x</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'income'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'school_count'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'park_area'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'distance_cbd'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span></code></pre></div><p>OLS 回归的 <code>spat_diag=True</code> 选项会输出一系列空间诊断检验，用于判断是否存在空间效应以及应选择哪种空间模型。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>诊断指标</th>\n<th>判断规则</th>\n<th>选择模型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>LM-Lag 显著，LM-Error 不显著</td>\n<td>p &lt; 0.05</td>\n<td>SLM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LM-Error 显著，LM-Lag 不显著</td>\n<td>p &lt; 0.05</td>\n<td>SEM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>两者都显著</td>\n<td>看 Robust 版本</td>\n<td>更显著的那个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>两者都不显著</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>OLS 即可</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>当两个 LM 检验都显著时，需要比较 Robust LM-Lag 和 Robust LM-Error——稳健版本在另一种空间效应存在的情况下仍然有效，因此更显著的那个指向真正的空间效应来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"空间滞后与空间误差模型\">空间滞后与空间误差模型</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"slm = ML_Lag(y, X, w=w,&#10;             name_y=&#39;house_price&#39;,&#10;             name_x=[&#39;income&#39;, &#39;school_count&#39;, &#39;park_area&#39;, &#39;distance_cbd&#39;])&#10;&#10;sem = ML_Error(y, X, w=w,&#10;               name_y=&#39;house_price&#39;,&#10;               name_x=[&#39;income&#39;, &#39;school_count&#39;, &#39;park_area&#39;, &#39;distance_cbd&#39;])\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">slm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ML_Lag(y, X, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">w</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">w,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">             name_y</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'house_price'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">             name_x</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'income'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'school_count'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'park_area'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'distance_cbd'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sem </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ML_Error(y, X, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">w</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">w,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">               name_y</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'house_price'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">               name_x</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'income'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'school_count'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'park_area'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'distance_cbd'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>比较维度</th>\n<th>空间滞后 SLM</th>\n<th>空间误差 SEM</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>空间参数</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span>（自回归系数）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>（误差系数）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解释</td>\n<td>邻居 y 影响自身 y</td>\n<td>遗漏空间因素</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>系数解释</td>\n<td>需计算直接/间接效应</td>\n<td>与 OLS 类似</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型含义</td>\n<td>实质性空间交互</td>\n<td>干扰性空间依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>政策含义</td>\n<td>存在空间溢出/乘数效应</td>\n<td>局部政策无溢出</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>空间滞后模型中，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 系数不能直接解释为&quot;X 变化一单位时 y 的边际效应&quot;——因为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mi>W</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho Wy</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 项引入了反馈循环（邻居的 y 变化又影响自身）。LeSage 和 Pace 提出将效应分解为直接效应（自身 X 对自身 y）和间接效应（自身 X 通过空间溢出对邻居 y 的影响）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"地理加权回归-gwr\">地理加权回归 GWR</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from mgwr.gwr import GWR&#10;from mgwr.sel_bw import Sel_BW&#10;&#10;coords = np.column_stack([gdf.geometry.centroid.x,&#10;                          gdf.geometry.centroid.y])&#10;&#10;sel = Sel_BW(coords, y, X, kernel=&#39;bisquare&#39;, fixed=False)&#10;bw = sel.search()&#10;&#10;gwr_model = GWR(coords, y, X, bw=bw, kernel=&#39;bisquare&#39;, fixed=False)&#10;gwr_results = gwr_model.fit()&#10;&#10;gdf[&#39;local_r2&#39;] = gwr_results.localR2&#10;for i, name in enumerate([&#39;income&#39;, &#39;school&#39;, &#39;park&#39;, &#39;cbd&#39;]):&#10;    gdf[f&#39;coef_{name}&#39;] = gwr_results.params[:, i + 1]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mgwr.gwr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> GWR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mgwr.sel_bw </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Sel_BW</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">coords </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.column_stack([gdf.geometry.centroid.x,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                          gdf.geometry.centroid.y])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sel </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Sel_BW(coords, y, X, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">kernel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'bisquare'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">fixed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">bw </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sel.search()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gwr_model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> GWR(coords, y, X, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">bw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">bw, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">kernel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'bisquare'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">fixed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gwr_results </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gwr_model.fit()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gdf[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'local_r2'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gwr_results.localR2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i, name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> enumerate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'income'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'school'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'park'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cbd'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    gdf[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'coef_</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">name</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gwr_results.params[:, i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>GWR 参数</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>选择方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>带宽</td>\n<td>局部回归窗口大小</td>\n<td>AICc 最小化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核函数</td>\n<td>权重衰减形式</td>\n<td>bisquare / gaussian</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>固定/自适应</td>\n<td>带宽单位</td>\n<td>自适应（K 近邻）更常用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>GWR 的输出核心是局部系数地图——通过将每个位置的回归系数映射到地图上，直观展示回归关系的空间变化。例如在房价模型中，学校对房价的影响可能在市中心很小（因为学校密集），在郊区很大（学校稀缺使其成为差异化因素）。</p>\n<p>多尺度 GWR（MGWR）进一步允许每个解释变量有不同的带宽，反映不同变量的空间变化尺度不同。收入的影响可能在大尺度上平滑变化，而学校的影响可能在小尺度上快速变化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"模型选择与诊断\">模型选择与诊断</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>OLS</th>\n<th>SLM</th>\n<th>SEM</th>\n<th>GWR</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>空间效应</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>全局溢出</td>\n<td>全局扰动</td>\n<td>局部异质</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>系数</td>\n<td>全局常数</td>\n<td>全局常数</td>\n<td>全局常数</td>\n<td>空间变化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型复杂度</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可解释性</td>\n<td>最强</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>中（可视化）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过拟合风险</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中-高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>模型选择的标准流程：先用 OLS 建立基准模型，检查残差的空间自相关（Moran&#39;s I）。如果显著，运行 LM 诊断选择 SLM 或 SEM。估计空间模型后检查残差是否消除了空间自相关。最后用 AICc 比较各模型的拟合优度。如果怀疑回归关系存在空间异质性，额外运行 GWR 进行探索性分析。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>空间数据的回归分析必须考虑空间自相关，否则 OLS 估计可能有偏</li>\n<li>空间权重矩阵定义邻接关系，Queen、KNN 和距离阈值是最常用的构建方法</li>\n<li>LM 诊断检验是选择 SLM 还是 SEM 的标准决策流程</li>\n<li>空间滞后模型的系数需要分解为直接效应和间接效应才能正确解释</li>\n<li>GWR 揭示回归关系的空间异质性，适合探索性分析和局部效应可视化</li>\n<li>MGWR 允许不同变量有不同的空间变化尺度，比标准 GWR 更灵活</li>\n<li>模型选择应基于理论假设和统计诊断，AICc 是模型比较的常用标准</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"地理空间回归模型","id":"地理空间回归模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"空间权重矩阵","id":"空间权重矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"空间诊断检验","id":"空间诊断检验"},{"level":2,"text":"空间滞后与空间误差模型","id":"空间滞后与空间误差模型"},{"level":2,"text":"地理加权回归 GWR","id":"地理加权回归-gwr"},{"level":2,"text":"模型选择与诊断","id":"模型选择与诊断"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"克里金与空间插值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/geospatial-data-analysis/spatial-statistics/kriging-and-interpolation"},"next":{"title":"Web 地图可视化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/geospatial-data-analysis/geospatial-applications/web-map-visualization"}}